#: __init__.py:641
msgid "A higher value will lighten a greater surface area ofthe mesh. A lower value will only lighten the absolute darkest partsof the mesh. Default value should work in most cases"
msgstr "数值越高，提亮的网格表面积越大。数值越低，只提亮网格中最暗的部分。默认值在大多数情况下即可。"

