#: __init__.py:673
msgid "The solid Base Color that transparent materials are temporarily set to while baking, so their albedo does not bleed dark into the vertex colors (green suits foliage)"
msgstr "烘焙时临时将透明材质设为的纯色基础色，以免其反照率把暗色渗入顶点色（绿色适合植被）"

#: __init__.py:1
msgid "Tools for encoding / compressing HDR images and vertex colors, for use in game engines"
msgstr "用于编码/压缩 HDR 图像和顶点色的工具，适用于游戏引擎"

