#: __init__.py:632
msgid "Vertex colors are divided by this before FBX export and multiplied by it (here or in a Unity shader) to restore the HDR range"
msgstr "FBX 导出前顶点色会除以该值，再在此处或 Unity 着色器中乘以该值以恢复 HDR 范围"

#: __init__.py:665
msgid "When parts of the mesh are completely buried, this setting will force the 'Fix Buried Vertices' button to sample nearby (unburied) faces and copy their colorto the completley buried islands"
msgstr "当网格的某些部分完全被埋没时，此设置会强制「修复被埋没顶点」按钮对附近（未埋没）的面采样，并将其颜色复制到完全被埋没的孤岛"

